_bmad-output/审查/evidence-g82/probe-BF-workflow-全量输出.json:50:            "evidence": "逐字 fixture（harness.py 落盘到 <vault>/outputs/今日复习.json）：\n{\n  \"schema_version\": 3,\n  \"generated_at\": \"2026-08-31T09:05:05+08:00\",\n  \"stats\": {\"due_nodes\": 0},\n  \"top_boards\": [],\n  \"upcoming\": [],\n  \"due_nodes\": [],\n  \"ineligible\": {\"placeholder\": []}\n}\n真调 `_vault_entry(Path(<lane>/v_ok), date(2026,8,31))` 返回：{\"vault_id\":\"v_ok\",\"path\":\"...\",\"status\":\"ok\",\"projection\":{\"schema_version\":3,\"vault_id\":null,\"date\":null,\"generated_at\":\"2026-08-31T09:05:05+08:00\",\"due_count\":0,\"placeholder_backlog\":0,\"recommended_board\":null,\"top_node\":null,\"pending\":null,\"next_upcoming\":null,\"boards\":[],\"due_new_count\":0,\"placeholder_attributed\":null,\"bucket_counts\":null},\"error\":null}",
_bmad-output/审查/evidence-g82/probe-BF-workflow-全量输出.json-51-            "impact_on_impl": "这 7 个键就是 fixture 的必需集，可直接作为 vault_lint 同源锁的 fixture 基座；改 generated_at 一个字段即可扫完整张矩阵。projection 里 boards=[] / bucket_counts=null 是**派生**结果，不是输入键，别照抄回输入。"
